WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:40.260
We boarded a train to retrieve the ruins' documents before Doma.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.970
But Doma was already there!

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.920
The train separated Yugi from me.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.860
Ryuzaki and Haga, now working for Doma, challenged us to a duel.

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:56.260
Do you know what you're doing?

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:04.100
Power Up Deck!
Haga & Ryuzaki

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:15.560
My turn!  I draw!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.930
The first turn of Parasite Caterpillar's effect!

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:20.880
What?

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:29.930
If Poison Butterfly hatches, I'll lose 500 life points every turn.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.850
The spell card, Polymerization!

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:38.670
I fuse Gaia The Fierce Knight and Curse of Dragon from my hand!

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:41.460
I summon Gaia the Dragon Champion!

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.180
Attack Leghul!

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.380
That won't work.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:51.160
I flip over my trap!

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.880
I activate DNA Surgery!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:55.220
What?

00:02:55.220 --> 00:03:01.660
As long as I have this card, faceup monsters become the Type of my choosing.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:05.200
And I choose Insect-Type, of course!

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:15.770
That activates Insect Barrier, stopping Gaia the Dragon Champion's attack!

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:21.780
He pretended to use Insect Barrier to stop Poison Butterfly.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:27.150
But he actually wanted to combo it with DNA Surgery to stop my attacks.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.900
Calm down, Yugi.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.160
Don't panic!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.320
I know!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.260
Yugi...

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.690
I end my turn.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.500
Don't lose, Jonouchi!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.070
Or you'll lose your soul!

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.010
I know!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:55.140
I feel the Orichalcos's power surging through my body!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.590
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:58.950
Here I go.

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.940
I activate the spell card, Polymerization!

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:05.820
I fuse Gilasaurus and Kaitoptera!

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.690
I summon Horned Saurus!

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:14.240
I also summon Giant Rex!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:19.390
Due to The Seal of Orichalcos, they both become dark monsters!

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.240
That's about it.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:29.430
I'll show you the strength of my Power Deck!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.330
Go, Horned Saurus!

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.850
Attack Jonouchi directly!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.780
What?

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.720
He has monsters!  How can it attack directly?

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.210
Not good enough.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:47.660
Due to its effect, it can attack you directly on the turn it's summoned.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.200
Jonouchi!

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:58.800
Get it together, Jonouchi!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.810
Be quiet!  I know!

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.400
There's more!

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.000
Giant Rex, attack Panther Warrior!

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:15.560
Oh no!  Jonouchi has no monsters left!

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.560
This was easier than I expected.

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.900
This will end you!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:24.320
Gilasaurus, attack Jonouchi directly!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.940
Jonouchi!

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.060
My Quick-Play Spell, Scapegoat!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.520
You don't know when to quit.

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.250
Or maybe I'm tough.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.420
Stop scaring me.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.120
I end my turn.

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.900
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:03.570
I activate the spell card, Cell Division!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.900
Leghul divides!

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.780
What?

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:17.390
This card lets me Special Summon a Cell Division Token of a Level 3 or lower Insect!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:22.460
You got a monster with only 800 attack points?

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.390
That's no problem.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:31.660
I'm surprised the former Duel King would say something like that.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.200
I wouldn't do this without a plan in mind.

00:06:36.110 --> 00:06:39.920
Losing against Rafael must've done a number on you.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.310
It's only natural.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:46.840
You lost your dear friend because of your foolishness.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:50.750
That's enough, cheater!

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.460
Sorry.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:55.550
I was talking to myself.  Ignore it.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.430
Haga!  How dare you!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.760
Aren't you the national champion?

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:03.400
Don't you have a champion's pride?

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.900
Don't get an attitude just because you're cute.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.830
People will hate you if you're arrogant.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.480
Well then...

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:19.840
I tribute Pheromone Wasp and Cell Division Token to summon Insect Queen!

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:28.560
The Queen has arrived!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:31.710
And The Orichalcos gives her attack points!

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.970
Insect Queen's effect activates!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:44.140
She gains 200 attack points for every faceup Insect on the field!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.580
My Insect Queen and Leghul.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:52.380
And your Gaia the Dragon Champion and Obnoxious Celtic Guard.  Four total!

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.820
200 times four equals 800!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.140
3500 attack points?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.740
Here I go, Yugi.

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:04.330
Leghul attacks you directly!

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:09.600
Leghul ignores your monsters and can attack you directly!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.750
I'm not done!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:16.140
My Queen will attack next.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:20.580
I tribute Leghul, and Insect Queen attacks!

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:26.550
My Queen will punish you!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.530
Queen's Hell Breath!

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.260
Gaia the Dragon Champion is destroyed!

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:41.330
When Insect Queen destroys a monster in battle, she lays an Insect Monster Token.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.000
I end my turn.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:55.250
Jonouchi!  I'll definitely defeat you today!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:09:00.650
I won't lose to a guy who needs Doma's help to fight!

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:07.490
Be quiet!  I'll use anything, including Doma, to defeat you!

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:10.300
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:14.000
I summon Rocket Warrior in defense position!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.470
I also set two cards!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.400
Ryuzaki!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:22.100
What?

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:25.110
You want power this badly?

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:29.020
Is dueling all about power?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:33.400
Jonouchi, when did you become an honor student?

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.400
That's just talk!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:39.790
A duel is always a serious fight!  You either win or lose!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.280
You're trash if you lose!

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.730
You're nothing unless you win!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.910
A duel is always a serious fight...

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:51.920
A duel is always a serious fight!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.900
You risk your own existence.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.910
That's how I've always fought.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.110
It's not just a game!

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:05.000
Damn, everyone says the same thing.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.250
I end my turn!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.690
My turn!  I draw!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.550
Horned Saurus attacks Rocket Warrior!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.760
I flip over my trap card!

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:20.110
Magic-Arm Shield!

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.470
Your monster will protect me!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.390
That won't happen!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.400
I flip over my Counter Trap!

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.840
I activate Jurassic Heart!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.150
What?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.860
All traps against Dinosaurs are negated!

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.300
I'll keep going!

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:51.230
Giant Rex, attack Scapegoat!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:56.910
Gilasaurus attacks Scapegoat!

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:05.360
I set one card.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.580
I end my turn.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:08.890
Damn!

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:12.380
This is bad.  C'mon, Jonouchi!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.480
My turn.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.550
Red-Eyes...

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.170
I'm low on life points.

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:44.010
I'm counting on you, Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:48.220
I tribute Scapegoat!

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.050
I activate the spell card, Star Blaster!

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:58.790
I can Special Summon a monster from my hand if its Level equals...

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.960
...my tributed monster's Level plus the number I roll.

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:06.330
C'mon!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.460
All right!  I rolled a 6!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:13.340
And the tributed Scapegoat's Level is 1!

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.340
6 plus 1 equals 7!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.880
He's lucky as ever.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.050
I Special Summon a Level 7 monster.

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:23.480
Its name is...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.310
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.090
W-What?

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.790
Red-Eyes B. Dragon...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.560
And I flip over my trap!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:38.000
I activate Metalmorph!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.870
It raises a monster's attack and defense points by 300!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:49.810
And when it attacks, it gains half the target's attack points!

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.750
Here I go, Ryuzaki!

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:56.580
Red-Eyes B. Dragon attacks Horned Saurus!

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:59.840
Horned Saurus has 2500 attack points.

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:05.730
Red-Eyes gains half - 1250 attack points!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.220
Horned Saurus is destroyed!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:12.070
All right!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.440
I set a card.

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.780
I end my turn!

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:27.180
Your turn, Yugi.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:31.220
Quit acting like a goody two-shoes and reveal your true self.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.480
What?

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.660
What do you mean, "true self?"

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.400
Oops.  Did I say something I shouldn't have?

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.430
Ignore me.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:43.240
Just say it, Haga!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:49.000
"Stop acting like a hero when you're just like us."

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.680
...is what I wasn't going to say.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.960
Stop it!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:59.680
You let the darkness take control and used The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.740
You're the same as us.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:05.660
...is what I wasn't going to say.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:11.160
Your arrogance cost you your partner.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.700
And you call yourself a true duelist?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.560
...is what I definitely wouldn't say.

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.820
I said stop it!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:27.880
Your strategy is to disturb me so that I'll make mistakes.

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.440
But it won't work!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:33.110
Oh?  Is that what you claim?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:36.280
But I see your hand shaking.

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:40.320
Yugi!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.890
I promise to defeat you today.

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:47.550
I've been waiting for this day to come!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:57.040
Red-Eyes is proof of me and Yugi's friendship!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.640
It's a monster of friendship!

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.840
Such nonsense!

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.850
That Red-Eyes used to belong to me!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:06.990
Don't brag when you stole it from me!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:10.020
Stole it?  Don't try to ruin my rep!

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:15.320
I won it fairly in a duel!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:19.860
In that duel at Duelist Kingdom...

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:31.670
Everything changed after that day.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:36.340
When Haga and I dueled for the national title...

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:41.860
...we were famous duelists.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:46.670
Look!  It's the national champ, Insector Haga!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.090
And second place, Dinosaur Ryuzaki!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.780
Wow!  It's really them!

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:58.800
They admired us.  It felt great.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:02.340
I felt like a king.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.890
But you're the real king, right?

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.940
Good luck!

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.640
You're our heroes!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.280
We're rooting for you!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.170
Umm...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.760
May I have your autograph, Mr. Haga?  Mr. Ryuzaki?

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:19.850
Autograph?

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.290
Sure.  Hand it over.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.670
Here, Ryuzaki.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.430
Yeah.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.200
Thank you very much!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.400
Wait.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:32.400
You thought it was for free?

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:36.090
You can pay us with your rare card.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.100
The world was ours.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.700
But it didn't last long.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:52.180
Jonouchi!  It's your fault!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.350
My fault?

00:16:54.600 --> 00:17:00.790
I finished 2nd in the nationals!  I can't lose to an amateur like you!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.250
It must be some mistake!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:07.340
Red-Eyes wasn't the only thing I lost.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.270
You hear about them?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:15.710
They lost early in Duelist Kingdom and sent home.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:18.710
And they lost their rare cards, too.

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:19.780
Pathetic!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.650
Yeah, right?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:25.210
The top two in the nationals were nothing special.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:28.550
People are fickle.

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:31.820
Their attitude changed overnight.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.190
Dammit!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.890
Everyone makes fun of me!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.600
Dammit!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:43.080
Yeah!  So annoying!

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.740
Are you Haga and Ryuzaki?

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:46.670
Whattaya want?

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:56.120
Is this your card?

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.370
Yeah!  Thanks, big bro!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.090
Huh?  Their autographs?

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:03.960
I threw it out.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:06.360
It'd be embarrassing if my friends saw it.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.010
It was miserable.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.780
Nothing worked out since then.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:18.930
Our lives were horrible.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:22.260
It's all your fault!

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.410
So what?

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.410
I said, "So what?"

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:29.820
You're miserable because you lost to me?

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:33.650
Nothing worked out because you lost to me?

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.530
Stop being a baby!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:36.420
What?

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:41.220
Ryuzaki, there's only one winner in a duel tournament.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.360
Everyone else loses.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.620
Everyone tries hard because they want to be the one!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:51.800
Don't talk like you're the only tragic hero!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.600
Be quiet!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:56.960
There's no tomorrow unless I defeat you!

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:59.740
Then fight fair and square!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:03.430
No matter how many times you lose, just keep challenging me!

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:06.010
I'll always accept your challenge!

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:10.090
I wasn't strong at the start.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:12.390
I'm still not.

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:15.840
I lost over and over.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.830
But I was determined to get better every time.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.700
And made it this far!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:28.920
I'm not a weak duelist like you, who sells his soul to Doma to get stronger!

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.310
Mai Kujaku was right.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.750
What?

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:38.680
You're so right that you're annoying.

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:44.620
Everyone works as hard as you, including Haga and Mai!

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:48.700
But what can't be done can't be done.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:53.000
Can you understand our pain, Jonouchi?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:58.040
A hothead like you can never understand my or Mai's pain!

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:00.470
Don't compare yourself with Mai!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:04.030
There's no point talking.

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.140
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:09.950
I tribute Gilasaurus and Giant Rex.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.860
I summon Tyrant Dragon!

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:22.630
The Seal of Orichalcos gives it 500 attack points!

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:27.670
Jonouchi!  I swear I'll defeat you!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.650
Bring it on!

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:42.150
Your hate is misplaced, Haga!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:44.420
I don't care.

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:49.200
The point is, you'll lose to me today.

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:52.260
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.790
The second turn of Parasite Caterpillar's effect!

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:05.670
I'll soon send you to your partner, who you cast our with your darkness.

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:07.760
Partner...

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:12.500
I summon Kuriboh in defense position!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:18.370
DNA Surgery's effect activates!

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:23.750
I'll save my partner with my own hands!

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:28.880
I set a card!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:30.530
I end my turn!

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:49.100
Don't lose, Yugi.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.840
If you're also gone...

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:10.080
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:18.490
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:29.580
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:39.100
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:48.130
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:53.640
I'll live feeling them

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:58.820
For me to be me

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:07.280
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:12.920
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:22.650
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:33.050
They joined Doma because they're mad at Yugi and Jonouchi?

00:23:33.050 --> 00:23:35.460
Ryuzaki and Haga lost their minds!

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:38.620
But Doma has strengthened their decks.

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:43.890
The Seal of Orichalcos has powered them up, cornering Yugi and Jonouchi.

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:47.500
The only option is to draw the legendary dragons!

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:49.310
With those cards...

00:23:49.310 --> 00:23:51.840
Yugi, what's wrong?

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:54.790
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Timaeus Fails to Activate

00:23:54.790 --> 00:23:56.290
Duel, standby!
